  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "对接形态",
      "items": [
        "litellm 是进程内 Python SDK：应用自己构造 Router 并直连厂商 API。",
        "全仓无 LITELLM_MASTER_KEY、:4000 服务或 Proxy /ui 接入。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "流量与记账",
      "items": [
        "主/兜底模型与多 Key deployment 由 model_list 编译；simple-shuffle + num_retries=2。",
        "usage / usage_metadata / _hidden_params 归一后写入 llm_usage；Web 设置页提供状态与 smoke test。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "管理边界",
      "items": [
        "官方 LiteLLM Proxy + Admin UI 需独立服务、master key 与数据库；本仓库未部署。",
        "LITELLM_CONFIG 只借用 model_list 格式；router_settings 在本仓库不生效。"
      ]
    }
  ]
